<Base title="About — Jah Noah" description="Artist | Technologist | Yogi"><article class="about-page"><header class="about-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Artist | Technologist | Yogi</p><h1>About Jah Noah.</h1><Connect client:load/></header><div class="about-columns"><div class="prose about-bio"><p class="about-opening">Hi, I'm JahNoah. An artist, technologist, and yogi with about twenty years of experience.</p><p>A.I. keeps trying to autocomplete my bio, and honestly it's doing a way better job than me at this whole self introduction thing, hahah. The irony. I am an objective believer in the power of genuine human connection, something that no AI can replecate. Not quite yet, at least.</p><p>Stiffy introductions aside, I teach courses on technology, facilitate yoga classes, as well as lecture publically at request. My primary occupation is consulting for individuals and companies on technology and systems development.</p><p>I like to have relaxed, in-person conversations prior to any professional engagement. No matter how intense a situation may be, a calm, centered approach is most important. Feel free to email me at any time at <a href="mailto:mail@jahnoah.com">mail@JahNoah.com</a> to introduce yourself and schedule a chat.</p><p>I look forward to meeting with you soon. Cheers!</p></div><aside class="about-video"><p class="eyebrow">Jah_Noah · YouTube</p><h2>Arduino MIDI Control with Joystick | Electronics Demo</h2><div class="video-frame"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/NzQkE8XGuPY" title="Arduino MIDI Control with Joystick | Electronics Demo — Jah Noah" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div><div class="video-links"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NzQkE8XGuPY">Watch on YouTube <span class="link-kind">External ↗</span></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@jah_noah">Jah_Noah channel <span class="link-kind">External ↗</span></a></div><a class="text-link" href="/Tech">Development &amp; experience</a></aside></div><section class="archived-voice"><header><p class="eyebrow">From my 2024 site</p><h2>Vision &amp; mission</h2></header><div><h3>Vision</h3><p>I aim to provide services along the path of harmony and balance for the ascension of my global family to their highest level.</p></div><div><h3>Mission</h3><p>I open channels for creative expression, and enrich my community with the knowledge and skills required to take action.</p></div><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20240221044242/https://jahnoah.com/about/">Original About page · February 21, 2024 <span class="link-kind">Wayback · External ↗</span></a></section></article></Base>
